---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";

const pageTitle = "About Me";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="A little introduction" title="Hello, I’m Vladislav." />
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      You can call me Vla. I'm a full-time software engineer, and my curiosity
      goes well beyond code.
    </p>

    <h2>What I Do</h2>

    <h3>Markets &amp; Investing</h3>
    <p>
      I manage my own portfolio across stocks, indices, and cryptocurrencies.
      From time to time, I also trade using Inner Circle Trader (ICT) concepts.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm interested in how markets behave, what drives economic decisions, and
      the psychology behind price movements.
    </p>

    <h3>Manga &amp; Scanlation</h3>
    <p>
      I contribute to MangaDex as a solo scanlator under an anonymous account,
      mainly working on English translations and occasionally Russian ones. It's
      a creative side project that lets me contribute to the manga community.
    </p>

    <h2>A Bit About My Background</h2>
    <p>
      I was born in Russia and have spent significant time living in Vietnam and
      Georgia.
    </p>
    <p>
      Living in these countries has given me firsthand experience with their
      local cultures, everyday life, and how things work beyond a tourist's
      perspective.
    </p>

    <h2>Why This Website Exists</h2>
    <p>
      No grand mission — just a place to share what I'm working on, what I've
      learned, and whatever catches my attention.
    </p>
    <p>
      I don't claim to know everything. I'm simply curious about how things
      work.
    </p>
    <p>
      If something here catches your interest, feel free to stick around and
      explore.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
